Tha Rabab Ka Nouha Loot Gaya Mera Kunba<br>
Mai Watan Na Jaongi Mai Watan Na Jaongi<br>
<br>
Nainawa Ke Maqtal Me Qatal Ho-Gaye Sarwar<br>
Sham Me Sakina Hai Karbala Me Hai Asghar<br>
Ho Ke Bekas-o-Tanha Mai Watan Na Jaungi<br>
<br>
Mai Ne Apni Aankhon Se Ghar Ujadte Dekha Hai<br>
Mai Ne Apne Bache Ke Sar Ko Kat-Te Dekha Hai<br>
Leke Qali Gaih-Wara Mai Watan Na Jaongi<br>
<br>
Jab Watan Se Nikli Thi Aap Bhi The Bicche Bhi<br>
Karbala Me Kya Aayi Goud Ho Gayi Qali<br>
Aur Suhag Bhi Ujda Mai Watan Na Jaongi<br>
<br>
Qaid-e-sham Se Chutkar Mai Yaha Na Aapati<br>
Sath Hi Sakina Ke Kash Mai Bhi Marjati<br>
Dagh Leke Bacchi Ka Mai Watan Na Jaongi<br>
<br>
Kya Karo Waha Jakar Aap Hi Bata-Di-Jiye<br>
Apne Qabr Me Wali Ab Mujhe Chipa-Li-Jiye<br>
Kaun Hai Waha Mera Mai Watan Na Jaongi<br>
<br>
Sabr Ka Kiya Wada Sabr Kar Liya Maine<br>
Har Qadam Musibat Par Shukr-e-Rab Kiya Maine<br>
Ab Yehi Hai Maroza Mai Watan Na Jaongi